  "_comment": "Admin credentials stored LOCALLY - not connected to Oracle/MySQL.",
  "_note": "Copy this file to admin_users.json and replace hashed_password with your own bcrypt hash. Generate one with: python -c \"import bcrypt; print(bcrypt.hashpw(b'yourpassword', bcrypt.gensalt()).decode())\"",
